<title>CANADA: Alberta Agriculture details crop growth to June 23.</title>
<headline>Alberta Agriculture details crop growth to June 23.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alberta Agriculture on Tuesday detailed the level of growth in crops to June 23.</p>
<p>		  CROP DEVELOPMENT (PCT)</p>
<p>CROP     TILLER/ROSETTE SHOTBLADE/FLOWER HEADED/PODDED</p>
<p>Spring Wheat  80 pct		13 pct	   0 pct</p>
<p>Oats	    80 pct		 8 pct	   0 pct</p>
<p>Barley	  77 pct		12 pct	   0 pct</p>
<p>Winter Wheat  -- pct		19 pct	  81 pct</p>
<p>Fall Rye	 7 pct		12 pct	  81 pct</p>
<p>Peas	    91 pct		 7 pct	   1 pct</p>
<p>Canola	  83 pct		12 pct	   0 pct</p>
<p>Flax	    98 pct		 2 pct	   0 pct</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras, Winnipeg Reuters bureau 204 947 3548))</p>
</text>
